W: Actually, we've had more than seventy people sign up so far.

3
00:00:11,995 --> 00:00:14,925
It appears as though we may have more than 100 attendees.

4
00:00:16,485 --> 00:00:18,525
M: The Diamond Room has a capacity of 150.

5
00:00:19,525 --> 00:00:23,085
It's our biggest room, but it's rented out on December 11.

6
00:00:23,685 --> 00:00:25,100
W: How about on the tenth?

7
00:00:25,475 --> 00:00:26,905
M: It's available the entire day.

8
00:00:27,265 --> 00:00:29,745
Perhaps it would be better to book it on an alternative date.

9
00:00:30,570 --> 00:00:32,865
W: I pretty much have to, don't I?

10
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:37,125
But I need to speak with my supervisor first to get confirmation.
